[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.55, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "每个人都可以像我一样拥有它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16982.868, "timestamp": "04:43:02", "text": "应该很罕见之类的。所以，随着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16984.788, "timestamp": "04:43:04", "text": "Vtuber 的东西，你知道我最先想要的就是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16987.43, "timestamp": "04:43:07", "text": "应该是我自己的，应该像这样，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16988.868, "timestamp": "04:43:08", "text": "它应该与……不同"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16992.31, "timestamp": "04:43:12", "text": "它应该具备的基本模型就像我一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16994.55, "timestamp": "04:43:14", "text": "我有个诱饵，好吧，我还没透露我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16998.07, "timestamp": "04:43:18", "text": "没错，我的模型是之前做的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17000.073, "timestamp": "04:43:20", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bro's sounding like sinder rn"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17000.788, "timestamp": "04:43:20", "text": "我创造了我的背景故事，我创造了整个故事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17003.472, "timestamp": "04:43:23", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "nahhh red flags"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17003.99, "timestamp": "04:43:23", "text": "故事讲完后，我受到了启发，想到了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17007.03, "timestamp": "04:43:27", "text": "我是否应该继续进行我的模型开发？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17009.968, "timestamp": "04:43:29", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lol"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17010.55, "timestamp": "04:43:30", "text": "我把它弄好了，所以我就……我没那么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17016.47, "timestamp": "04:43:36", "text": "我刚醒来就上了Veroid。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17018.788, "timestamp": "04:43:38", "text": "我自己做了一个模型。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17020.47, "timestamp": "04:43:40", "text": "该死。好了，现在我要开始讲述我的故事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17022.07, "timestamp": "04:43:42", "text": "周围。我并没有那样做。我只是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17022.709, "timestamp": "04:43:42", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmao"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17025.67, "timestamp": "04:43:45", "text": "我先构思了一个故事，然后才开始制作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17028.31, "timestamp": "04:43:48", "text": "那种类型的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17030.47, "timestamp": "04:43:50", "text": "那挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17032.55, "timestamp": "04:43:52", "text": "甚至我的眼睛都不一样，所以它们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17034.708, "timestamp": "04:43:54", "text": "具有意义。为什么我有一个红色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17037.43, "timestamp": "04:43:57", "text": "蓝色红色？比如蓝眼睛。我就是没做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17039.11, "timestamp": "04:43:59", "text": "这样做是因为它看起来……"}]